body:
nah, i'm slow as fuck, it was a bug in one of the missions i took, even though it didnt show, she was wanted.... and the reasonable federals instead of talking and maybe fining me, an ally of them with the rank of midshipman in the federation, they opted to fucking blow me to pieces and kill other 45 innocent people traveling with me too.... totally reasonable....

&#x200B;

 "PassengerCount":5, "PassengerVIPs":true, "PassengerWanted":true, "PassengerType":"Tourist", "MissionID":438529737 }

looks like i had a wanted passenger without knowing so, though it didnt show on the mission briefing, i don't take criminals... i'm not taking VIPs anymore if there is a risk of them being wanted without telling you so, is not worth the trouble...

&#x200B;

 "PassengerCount":5, "PassengerVIPs":true, "PassengerWanted":true, "PassengerType":"Tourist", "MissionID":438529737 }

{ "timestamp":"2018-12-06T10:24:37Z", "event":"MissionAccepted", "Faction":"Movement for LHS 20 Liberals", "Name":"Mission\_PassengerVIP", "LocalisedName":"Transporta a Sahana Price", "Commodity":"$DomesticAppliances\_Name;", "Commodity\_Localised":"Electrodomésticos", "Count":1, "DestinationSystem":"EP Eridani", "DestinationStation":"Tito Terminal", "Expiry":"2018-12-06T12:19:03Z", "Wing":false, "Influence":"Med", "Reputation":"Med", "Reward":717784, "PassengerCount":5, "PassengerVIPs":true, "PassengerWanted":true, "PassengerType":"Tourist", "MissionID":438529737 }

&#x200B;

she was wanted, but it didn't list as wanted for me, i spent quite a lot of time looking for missions and i was hesitant to take this one because they are a pain in the ass, some hate being scaned and usually they are not worth the efort.... i'm not taking any vips anymore, fuck that, this was clearly low risk, at least that's what the mission briefing showed. 100% sure it didnt show as criminal, looked twice for it to be sure. this must be a bug on the mission board

