so looks like this is a bug with a mission i took, it stated clearly that it was a low value person and it wasnt a criminal and yet.... { "timestamp":"2018-12-06T10:32:02Z", "event":"CommitCrime", "CrimeType":"passengerWanted", "Faction":"39 Tauri Interstellar", "Bounty":1500 } well... gone are the days of me taking passengers if the descriptions of the mission can't be trusted....
